    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: SBQQ__ContractedPrice__c records whose linked product is inactive.
Why it matters: Inactive products can&apos;t sell, but the contracted price still occupies catalog space and references something invisible to reps. Cleanup hygiene; signals abandoned product retirements.
Suppress a finding: during the inactivation window where contracts must run out before the price can be removed.
Disable the detector: most orgs should leave on; it&apos;s pure hygiene.</value></values>
